OL,3,GNEWSAPatient injuries at mental health
OL,4,Atrust rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn increase in patient injuries at
OL,7,FSurrey's largest mental health trust
OL,8,Fwas due to the opening of an inpatient
OL,9,Ffacility last year, the trust has said.
OL,11,FData obtained by a Freedom of
OL,12,FInformation (FOI) request to Surrey and
OL,13,FBorders Partnership NHS Foundation
OL,14,FTrust (SABP) found injuries more than
OL,15,Fquadrupled in two years.
OL,17,FIn 2023/24, 92 service user injuries
OL,18,Fwere reported, rising to 365 incidents
OL,19,Fin 2024/25 and 431 in 2025/26 ` more
OL,20,Fthan one incident reported daily on
OL,21,Faverage in the most recent complete
OL,22,Ffinancial year.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
