OL,3,GNEWSAPatient injuries at mental health
OL,4,Atrust rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FA total of 141 incidents had been
OL,7,Freported in the ongoing 2026/27
OL,8,Ffinancial year at the time of the FOI
OL,9,Fresponse, the Local Democracy Reporting
OL,10,FService, external (LDRS) said.
